    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "\"With a superb historian's command of the subject, Johnson places Jesus in the context of the Roman Empire, into which he was born. With a masterly writer's love of language, Johnson elucidates Jesus's profound teachings. With a believer's passion, he reaches \"behind the written text to the full meaning of sayings and episodes which need to be explained afresh to each generation.\" The result is a probing, lucid, deeply moving biography of a man whose life changed the course of history.\"--Page 2 of cover."
    },
